## 2026-11-18 — Premium P22 complete
- Toasts, selection popover, and sheets per premium §7.13, §7.14, §7.16. `ClinicalToaster` is now `material-thick` + `shadow-popover`, `r-lg`, padding 12 16, min-height 48, a grid `auto 1fr auto` with gap 12, width `min(380px, 100vw − 32px)`, z 70 (inline, since Sonner's own z-index is unlayered), `expand`, 3 visible, 4 s, mobile offset 16 + safe area. Icons are 16 px `text-secondary` lucide `check` / `info` / `circle-alert`. The action is a `control` primary text button. Focus inside a toast pauses it as hover does. The truncated-file toast is now `toast.error`: it persists and has a 24 px "Dismiss" `x` button. The selection popover is 240 wide on `material-thick`, padding 12 16. It reads "148 dies selected", "31 failed, 79.1% yield", "Most loss: <bdi>SBIN 7</bdi>", then a text "Clear" with an "Esc" keycap. "Zoom to selection" and its handler are removed. `ModalSheet` has a desktop "Close" icon button 16 / 16 from the top-right and `size="wide"` (560) for error details, which now uses a `title-2` title. Keys: `selection.summary`, `selection.mostLoss`, and `sheet.close` added; `selection.failing/yield/topBin/zoom` removed; `selection.dies.*` reworded; 241 keys in all 5 locales.
